    "notes": {
        "4ae0e4e3-0df3-4164-965c-c6974cc13513": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 288,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe Notion integration sees only the pages that were shared with it when the account was connected.\n\n1. Connect the Notion account and, in the page picker of the consent screen, share at least one page.\n2. **List Pages** returns the most recently edited shared page; **Create Page** creates a child page under it.\n3. The cleanup step archives the created page (`PATCH /pages/{id}` with `archived: true`).\n\nWith no shared page List Pages fails with \"No records available for first output type\"."
        }
    }
